{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bilibili: @WaterwoodStudio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to college life! &quot;My Time: University Diary&quot; is a simulation and role-playing game set against the backdrop of university life. Players take on the role of a freshman and experience a complete campus journey from military training to graduation! You can choose different majors, join various clubs, participate in campus activities, and develop deep emotional connections with multiple female characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meticulously crafted script with 400,000 words.Dozens of different endings.Five heroines with distinct personalities that can be pursued.Four major categories to choose from, shaping entirely different life paths.Four joinable clubs, ranging from art and sports to politics, each unlocking unique endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/896fd52ef0f65c798641183c8f5c0fd5.webp?t=1772147548\" width=600 height=60 /></span>Five heroines with distinct personalities, each with their own unique and profound story. Whether you become their soulmate or a close confidant, the choice is entirely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/500f759ff3b4d49990fbd6722a5a7e64.avif?t=1772147548\" width=574 height=359 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/23c8cdf0519c776a8fb1e7f0459c9792.avif?t=1772147548\" width=574 height=287 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/fca9013dd28a45a02e7f71e81465db5c.avif?t=1772147548\" width=574 height=287 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/c6ce598b7625cafffbf78ca430233190.avif?t=1772147548\" width=574 height=287 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/a752d5c9e2b39c984aacf3e63695a165.avif?t=1772147548\" width=574 height=287 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/80604af182093d551c51923978d12f16.avif?t=1772147548\" width=574 height=287 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/59f2b8be6902b822d86c05b4c4924207.webp?t=1772147548\" width=600 height=60 /></span>Three roommates with different backgrounds and personalities will fill your four years of college life with laughter! Discuss life, share dreams, tell ghost stories\u2014there\u2019s nothing you can't do with your brothers by your side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/ae89284070205444106a8cb89fa744ef.avif?t=1772147548\" width=574 height=359 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/0e221f7fd2bd991184b762e7989a3178.webp?t=1772147548\" width=600 height=60 /></span>The game features over 60 different scenes, including more than 20 dynamic ones, where unexpected encounters and surprises await at every turn. You'll meet a variety of characters\u2014some might be industry leaders, while others could be deceptive vendors. They could become your mentors or your adversaries! The game is full of surprises and unexpected twists!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/42bba2e8d536b17e24a7bdda779ce66d.poster.avif?t=1772147548\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/42bba2e8d536b17e24a7bdda779ce66d.webm?t=1772147548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/42bba2e8d536b17e24a7bdda779ce66d.mp4?t=1772147548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/502953edf8a4b169ae275dd6701906d5.avif?t=1772147548\" width=574 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/c51e570986aa61bd3250ce0f49f19133.webp?t=1772147548\" width=600 height=60 /></span>The game offers a wide range of vibrant club activities, including the basketball team, drama club, music society, and student council. Whether you aspire to become a professional basketball player, a performing artist, or a politician aiming to change society, the choice is yours. The game features dozens of scenes to explore, along with numerous special events that grant unique bonus items. Plan your college life wisely and make every day fulfilling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/7995f5f784a66c123dcdfa73b6f876ae.poster.avif?t=1772147548\" width=562 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/7995f5f784a66c123dcdfa73b6f876ae.webm?t=1772147548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/7995f5f784a66c123dcdfa73b6f876ae.mp4?t=1772147548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/07fb8db40d51f855f00f8cea7d74e127.poster.avif?t=1772147548\" width=562 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/07fb8db40d51f855f00f8cea7d74e127.webm?t=1772147548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/07fb8db40d51f855f00f8cea7d74e127.mp4?t=1772147548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944760/extras/14e49c0dca24de80beb9a8983b71426d.webp?t=1772147548\" width=600 height=60 /></span>The game offers dozens of possible endings\u2014become a professional basketball player, a singer, an actor, or an engineer developing tech to serve your country. You could also enter politics or business, or retreat to the mountains to live as a peaceful hermit. The choice is entirely yours!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u7389\u7476\u7684\u604b\u4eba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944760/3aa7e53554fd06b976300ef6e2f2ae552e1f3c2c.jpg"},{"name":"\u6b27\u9633\u7684\u604b\u4eba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944760/f49f861f2e8f06661061a018153cfe1c9ef4209c.jpg"},{"name":"\u7d2b\u6668\u7684\u604b\u4eba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944760/c61f1425899c359a205eafaa2930eeca52faf2b2.jpg"},{"name":"\u6797\u9896\u7684\u604b\u4e